  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed extensions by reason of their inappropriate scale and design would fail to appear subservient and proportionate to the host building. It would harm the character and appearance of the locally listed building and wider conservation area contrary to Local Plan policies CC1, CC2, and CC4. ",
